  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></math> and <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then for <math><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
